meta {
  name: Follows - Chat - Unmute
  type: http
  seq: 181
}

delete {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/spaces/<cuid of a chat space>/messages/<cuid of a first-level message>/mute
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  Undo the mute of a chat thread (#1509): the thread gets back the state and the reason that it had before the first mute (no follow at all for a thread that had none). The notifications that the mute deleted do not come back. A thread that is not muted does not change: the answer is its current state. Needs notifications:write.
}
